<view class="screen"><view class="heading">每日体重打卡</view><view class="subtitle">保存今日体重即可打卡，同一天多次记录只计一天。</view><view wx:if="{{status === 'error'}}" class="error-box" bindtap="load">体重记录暂未同步 · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" class="empty">正在同步体重记录…</view><view class="section"><view class="muted">{{info.checkin.today ? '今天已打卡，可以继续更新体重' : '今日待打卡'}}</view><view class="row stack"><text>当前体重</text><text class="value">{{current || '未记录'}}{{info.currentWeight ? ' kg' : ''}}</text></view><input class="field" type="digit" value="{{weight}}" placeholder="输入今日体重（kg）" disabled="{{pendingWeight || saving || status !== 'ready'}}" data-field="weight" bindinput="input" /><button class="action" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || status !== 'ready'}}" bindtap="saveWeight">{{pendingWeight ? '重试确认这次记录' : info.checkin.today ? '再次记录体重' : '记录体重并打卡'}}</button></view><view class="section"><view class="section-title">体重目标</view><view wx:if="{{info.goal}}"><view class="row"><text>起点 {{startKg}} kg</text><text>目标 {{targetKg}} kg</text></view><view class="progress" wx:if="{{info.goal.percent !== null}}"><view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{info.goal.percent}}%"></view></view><view class="muted">{{info.goal.percent !== null ? '阶段进度 ' + info.goal.percent + '% · ' : ''}}起点减去当前 {{changeKg}} kg</view></view><view wx:else class="muted">目标可以晚一点再设，不影响其他功能。</view><input class="field" type="digit" value="{{target}}" placeholder="目标体重（kg）" disabled="{{pendingGoal || saving || status !== 'ready'}}" data-field="target" bindinput="input" /><button class="soft-button" disabled="{{saving || status !== 'ready'}}" bindtap="saveGoal">{{pendingGoal ? '重试确认目标' : info.goal ? '修改目标并开启新阶段' : '设置目标'}}</button></view><view class="section"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">体重趋势</text><view class="row"><text class="link" data-days="7" bindtap="days">7天</text><text class="link" data-days="30" bindtap="days">30天</text></view></view><weight-chart points="{{points}}" /></view><view class="section"><view class="section-title">体重记录</view><view class="muted">每次记录都会保留，趋势展示每天最后一次体重。</view><view wx:if="{{historyStatus === 'error'}}" class="error-box" bindtap="retryHistory">记录列表加载失败 · 点击重试</view><view class="empty" wx:elif="{{!history.length}}">{{historyStatus === 'loading' ? '正在加载记录…' : '还没有记录'}}</view><view class="list-item row" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="_id"><text class="muted">{{item.time}}</text><text>{{item.kg}} kg</text></view><button wx:if="{{moreHistory}}" class="soft-button" loading="{{historyStatus === 'loading'}}" disabled="{{historyStatus === 'loading'}}" bindtap="more">查看更多</button></view></view>

